# Lance root shaft (#562, D129), native 8x16: shaft1, shaft2 (the column tile: a pale bleached wood edge round crimson heartwood,
# dark bark rings; swapped every 0.05 s so the rings climb), top1, top2 (the 8 px bone tip in the upper 8 rows; the lower 8 stay empty).
# The outline is pale, not ink: ink vanishes on the night (D92), the pale wood and bone carry the contrast (D76).
